@2930[end]. The soul of the body is its spirit, for from this the body lives.

@2973[5]. With those who are in celestial and spiritual love, good from the Lord inflows through the soul into the body. Thus "the body" becomes "light." But with those who are in bodily and worldly love, good from the Lord cannot inflow through the soul into the body, but their interiors are in darkness. Hence also "the body" becomes "dark" (Matthew 6:22, 23).

@2992[end]. Thus the Angels... know everything which is in the body.

@3212[3]. The body is only the covering of man's spirit.

@3219[end]. It is contrary to order for what is posterior to flow into what is prior, thus the body into the soul.

@3293[2]. The outward man, that is, the things of the body.

@3300. Good is clothed with truth as with a tender body.

@3464[2]. "His body", and "the bread" = love to the Lord.

