@3849[2]. Under <Appetite>, see this reference.

@3884. Although I was (in Heaven) I was not out of myself, but in the body, for Heaven is in man... So when it pleases the Lord, a man can be in Heaven, yet not withdrawn from the body.

@3890. All the Societies... act as one, as do all things in the body, although so various.

