@4292[4]. All things of the body represent those of the mind -animi-, and of the mind -mentis-. Enumerated.

@4302[3]. Truths and goods, as to both generals and particulars, are in Heaven arranged in this order, that one regards another in such a form, as do the members, organs, and viscera of the human body, or the uses of them...

@4345[3]. The body itself and the things of the body... are relatively the most general things... Explained.

@4364[end]. The body an instrument or material organ. @5948.

@4373. The life which is in the body is not of the body, but of the soul, that is, through the soul from the Lord, and yet it appears to be of the body...

