@4205. A limit of the influx of good. Signified.

@9433[end]. "A bound that they may not pass over" (Psalms 104:9) = the ultimate of truth Divine...

@SE 2151. They are not allowed to go beyond fixed limits which are the limits of permission, and the limits are such that nothing is ever permitted except what is turned into good by the Lord.

Boundary. Term.; Terminus.
Terminate.; Terminare.
Termination.; Terminatio.
