@9393[end]. "Flesh" and "the bread" = the Divine good of the Lord's Divine love towards the universal human race, and the reciprocal [love] of man to the Lord. @10040[2].

@9412[6]. To "break the bread and give to them" (Luke 24:30) in the Spiritual World = to instruct in the good and truth of faith, through which the Lord appears.

@9455[end]. "The breads of faces upon the table," and the candlestick, represented the celestial things which are from the Lord in the Heavens.

