@9470[2]. "Bread and waters" (Hosea 2:5) = the internal goods of love and truths of faith; "wool and flax" = the same, but external.

@9543. "The breads of faces" = the celestial good which is from the Lord. @AE 324[25]. @491[4].

@9545. "Thou shalt set upon the table the bread of faces" (Exodus 25:30) = the Lord there as to celestial good.

