Breeches.; Femoralia.

@AC 9959. "Thou shalt make them linen breeches" (Exodus 28:42) = the external of [marriage] love... because they covered the loins... The reason the breeches were of linen, was that "linen" = external or natural truth; and the very external itself is truth. @9960. @9961. @9962.

@9962. Hence "the breeches" which were upon Aaron and his sons were for a protection from the Hells. Explained.

@CL 15[end]. The courtiers wore... breeches and stockings of opaline silk.

