@AC 7643[4]. The falsity which is in the outermost things of the Natural is meant by "a locust;" and the evil there, by "an unwinged locust." Illustrated. @9331[5]. @AE 543[8].

@AE 543[8]. "The bruchus" is also a locust...

Bruise.; Contundere. Tundere.
